  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Rigid and blunt college student Kwon Jeong-Ha can’t stand Gwak Hyeon-Wu, a handsome, popular classmate who casually toyed with the senior Jeong-Ha secretly loved. The two clash every time they meet… until Jeong-Ha picks up a mysterious necklace and their relationship flips overnight. Claiming he’s a demon, Hyeon-Wu reveals that all the magic he’d stored in the necklace has been absorbed by Jeong-Ha. To make matters worse, Jeongha will die unless it’s returned. But the only way to transfer the magic back? Physical contact. Forced into an uneasy cohabitation with a demon he despises, Jeong-Ha’s quiet life quickly descends into chaos. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
